{"title":"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The area of a right triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f27da4fca6f3fecb215974023aad210b70ec3857.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. If the circumradius of this triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and the inradius of this triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, where r can be written in the form:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/4/0b4d941e3801f3da426530a82aa5e5d5e6ccb9de.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[r=\\sqrt{m}+n\\]\" width=\"96\" height=\"18\" />\nwhere <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/5/0f506cc197a19861e22182e78e75b9072be3ebb0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m,n\\in\\mathbb{Z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"18\" />, find the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/d/02dbab3601fa6cce490d54263017048f69e1a35d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/d/69d0667cc9b67279ae55f58bced6392236a085ae.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] import geometry; unitsize(5mm);  size(8cm, 0); pair A = (0,0); pair B = (sqrt(109)-sqrt(19),0); pair C = (0,sqrt(109)+sqrt(19)); pair O = ((sqrt(109)/2-sqrt(19)/2),(sqrt(109)/2+sqrt(19)/2)); real r = sqrt(109)-8; pair incenter = (r,r);  draw(A--B--C--cycle, linewidth(1pt) + black); draw(A--(0,0.55)--(0.55,0.55)--(0.55,0)--cycle, linewidth(1pt) + black); draw(circle(O,8),linewidth(1pt)+black); draw(circle(incenter,r),linewidth(1pt)+black); draw(incenter--(r,0),linewidth(1pt)+black); dot(incenter); dot(O); label(&quot;$r$&quot;,(r,r/2),E); label(&quot;$A$&quot;, A, SW); label(&quot;$B$&quot;, B, SE); label(&quot;$C$&quot;, C, NW); label(&quot;$O$&quot;, O, NE); [/asy]\" width=\"382\" height=\"392\" /></center>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/3/54360a688b16c689d325b111cf73249bcd99183c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AC}=a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/d/36d55bf645ec32cafb040823f19d0dbd533e2d88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AB}=b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/c/9ecb1f9b0fe194b4ebc5c72f96a588f61613a11c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BC}=c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"63\" height=\"18\" />. Notice that by <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Thales%27_theorem\">Thales' Theorem</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/c/9ecb1f9b0fe194b4ebc5c72f96a588f61613a11c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BC}=c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"63\" height=\"18\" /> is equal to the circumdiameter of triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/8/df89babc797e1c11cefe060821014fc64dffedfe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=2\\cdot8=16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"108\" height=\"14\" />. Since the area is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f27da4fca6f3fecb215974023aad210b70ec3857.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> is a right triangle, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/0/f007d2c28956bae58e80a2e1dd7e09f2b38bf2d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab=45\\cdot2=90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"126\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>By the Pythagorean Theorem, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/3/ec3e1b3ff78e8701156acffa6043e89c408d58fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2+b^2=(16)^2=256$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"172\" height=\"21\" />. We can add <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/5/495e672ba855e22148cfa9f15c97ce96ad958bb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2ab=180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"80\" height=\"14\" /> to both sides to make the LHS a perfect square:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/4/6447f4b027598ad103ba76bc1d7c7ec2166c411e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^2+b^2+2ab=256+180 \\implies (a+b)^2=436 \\implies a+b=\\sqrt{436} \\implies b=2\\sqrt{109}-a\\]\" width=\"638\" height=\"21\" />\nThe circumradius of a triangle is given by:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/e/ede0117f2878f476f209e2e8ea0804b829f54980.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[r=\\frac{2\\cdot[\\triangle ABC]}{a+b+c}\\]\" width=\"126\" height=\"40\" />\nwhere [\\triangle ABC] denotes the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />. Now, substitute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/0/380c6b42c80692f21395dd4fdf38c1bcae733a7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=2\\sqrt{109}-a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"117\" height=\"21\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/1/4514788b72d9f2c0475055a174f7471c1e7cf8ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=16$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/d/8ad8f4921c7203a7bd58c4fc1e4772e7b7221160.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[\\triangle ABC]=45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"113\" height=\"20\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/7/877d9a145692515461750ca050f679196407f0fc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[r=\\frac{2\\cdot[\\triangle ABC]}{a+b+c}=\\frac{2\\cdot45}{\\left(a+2\\sqrt{109}-a+16\\right)}=\\frac{45}{\\sqrt{109}+8}= \\frac{45\\left(\\sqrt{109}-8\\right)}{\\left(\\sqrt{109}+8\\right)\\left(\\sqrt{109}-8\\right)}=\\sqrt{109}-8\\]\" width=\"745\" height=\"69\" />\nWe find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/e/d3eae473783921c238048fe0532d0fc379b8d66c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r=\\sqrt{109}-8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"109\" height=\"21\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/f/93f546adf15b2178e55f6ccc21aae9f8ff4c6328.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r=\\sqrt{m}+n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"99\" height=\"21\" /> which implies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/c/3fca194ce20f8df03c17e3227e90baf029b31972.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=109$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"69\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/c/54cc8daa90bbdbc2f150f4cb74214c8e51f4067e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=-8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"60\" height=\"15\" />. Finally, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/e/c2ea243268d3cc4ca71b7b2376261ce9549f721f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+n=109-8=\\boxed{101}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"197\" height=\"25\" />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO\">2026 Indonesia District MO </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 11 (page does not exist)\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 12 (page does not exist)\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 14 (page does not exist)\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 16 (page does not exist)\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 17 (page does not exist)\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 19 (page does not exist)\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 20 (page does not exist)\">20</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indonesia_District_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Indonesia District MO Problems and Solutions\"> All Indonesia District MO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018035000\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 175/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2036/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 104/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6304/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.734      1 Template:Indonesia_District_MO_box\n100.00%    8.734      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37813:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018035000 and revision id 2921